    <h1>For licensed medical professionals. <em>$25/month off, for as long as you stay.</em></h1>
    <p>If you are a licensed physician, nurse, dentist, allied-health practitioner, or mental-health clinician who is building a private practice or a side practice, you get a permanent discount on every plan I offer. There is no expiration date, no fine print, and no "first ninety days only" catch attached to it. The work you do is hard and the licensing burden behind it is real, and the discount is meant as a small thank-you for both.</p>
